IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LLM-PROXY-CLIENT-TEST.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT API-LOG ASSIGN TO 'api_test.log'.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD API-LOG.
01 LOG-REC PIC X(200).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STATUS PIC X(20).
01 WS-MODEL-NAME PIC X(20) VALUE 'GPT-4-VIA-CC-CONNECT'.
01 WS-PROMPT PIC X(50) VALUE 'Analyze this transaction code'.
01 WS-TIMESTAMP PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY '--- STARTING LLM PROXY TEST ---'.
    DISPLAY 'TARGET MODEL: ' WS-MODEL-NAME.
    DISPLAY 'PROMPT: ' WS-PROMPT.
    
    * Simulating a log entry for every request
    MOVE 'REQ-SENT' TO WS-STATUS.
    WRITE LOG-REC FROM WS-STATUS.
    
    * Simulate the processing time of the proxy
    DISPLAY 'WAITING FOR CC CONNECT RESPONSE...'.
    DISPLAY 'STATUS: SUCCESS'.
    DISPLAY 'RESPONSE: [{"choice": "Transaction is valid"}]'.
    
    DISPLAY '--- TEST COMPLETED ---'.
    STOP RUN.